WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.415
Open Quantization and certificates in the new research menu. These are independent diagnostics, with exact

00:00:07.415 --> 00:00:14.825
rational inputs and separate assumptions. The guided demo changes real controls. A passing arithmetic

00:00:14.825 --> 00:00:22.500
criterion is one ingredient of consistency. It does not certify a complete gauge Higgs model.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:31.785
Choose C over two. The universal class fails, while periods on closed spin four manifolds pass. This is not

00:00:31.785 --> 00:00:40.155
a contradiction. The tests use different backgrounds. The universal test detects a period of one half. On

00:00:40.155 --> 00:00:47.110
the stated spin backgrounds, the period of Y squared is even. That topological fact is external to the Lean

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.708
arithmetic proof.

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:56.893
The diamonds are universal integral classes. The rings between them pass only the closed spin four period

00:00:56.893 --> 00:01:04.848
test. The cross marks the current alpha and delta, at fixed beta. Select a lattice point in the application

00:01:04.848 --> 00:01:13.033
and the input gamma changes exactly. These are mathematical criteria, not experimental measurements. Outside

00:01:13.033 --> 00:01:20.333
the displayed window, the interface reports the exact coordinates instead of clipping a point to the border.

00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:28.628
Now choose C over thirty six. The covering direction gives an integer, one. But the displayed quotient

00:01:28.628 --> 00:01:36.083
cocharacter gives one over thirty six. Checking a convenient covering direction can miss a forbidden period.

00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:42.753
Read the witness together with the criterion. The application uses exact fractions, not a floating point

00:01:42.753 --> 00:01:44.958
tolerance.

00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:53.373
Choose A plus B. Alpha and beta are one; gamma is seven twelfths. After changing to the integral basis,

00:01:53.373 --> 00:02:01.058
delta is zero. Both criteria pass. The fractional contributions have to be combined before judging the total

00:02:01.058 --> 00:02:08.500
class. The controls, the witness and the exported result all use the same calculation.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:15.990
The axion panel uses the normalization of Choi and collaborators. The integer combination eighteen K two

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:24.215
plus twenty four K three plus K one must be divisible by thirty six. The default zero, one, twelve satisfies

00:02:24.215 --> 00:02:31.750
it. This reproduces the published q equals six condition. Identifying this axion with the gauge Higgs field

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:36.250
remains a separate, unresolved physical question.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:43.180
The parent map has two columns and a common annihilator. With the inherited spectrum and ordinary integral

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:50.805
Green Schwarz sources, six times the annihilator is sixteen minus three p minus three q minus six r. For

00:02:50.805 --> 00:02:58.935
integer pairings it is one modulo three, so it cannot vanish. Lean proves that arithmetic for all integers.

00:02:58.935 --> 00:03:05.250
Allowed orbifold backgrounds and extra corner responses are not settled by this result.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:12.775
The U two example shows why joint integrality differs from separate factor requirements. With b zero equal

00:03:12.775 --> 00:03:20.265
to one and b one equal to six, the quadratic form is m squared plus m n plus n squared. It is integral for

00:03:20.265 --> 00:03:26.495
every integer pair. The formal criterion also covers rational coefficients with a common nonzero

00:03:26.495 --> 00:03:33.042
denominator. This example is not an anomaly free supergravity spectrum.

00:03:33.792 --> 00:03:41.667
Change b one from six to five. Each cell is a cocharacter labelled by integers m and n. Its printed fraction

00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:49.522
and color are Q modulo one, calculated with exact integer arithmetic. The point one, zero now has period

00:03:49.522 --> 00:03:57.332
seven eighths: a concrete witness of failure. Returning b one to six makes every cell integral. The eighty

00:03:57.332 --> 00:04:04.208
one cells illustrate the criterion; the Lean theorem establishes it for all integer pairs.

00:04:04.958 --> 00:04:11.533
For the Spin twenty audit, the degree eighteen Clifford element squares to minus one. Multiplication by

00:04:11.533 --> 00:04:17.783
minus i makes the representation matrix square to plus one. This distinction matters for an ordinary

00:04:17.783 --> 00:04:25.818
isotropy lift. It does not prove the model inconsistent: a twisted or combined action may be possible. Every

00:04:25.818 --> 00:04:32.708
field and interaction, including bosonic Omega, must share a specified action.

00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:39.598
The catalogue includes four Lean files with forty nine theorem declarations, the exact audit scripts,

00:04:39.598 --> 00:04:47.403
recorded checks and file hashes. All four files replay with Lean four point twenty seven. The older S U

00:04:47.403 --> 00:04:54.288
seven file was adapted from List bind to List flat Map, keeping its theorem statements. Download the

00:04:54.288 --> 00:05:01.723
evidence, verify its integrity and run the listed commands. Full anomaly cancellation and scientific novelty

00:05:01.723 --> 00:05:04.000
remain open.

